        <div id="after" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>If You Miss Cyber Monday</h2>
<p>
            Pad prices rarely stay at their Cyber Monday level for long, but they rarely jump far either. Between our October
            checks and Black Friday the pads on this page moved by $8 to $83, not by the hundreds their “compare at” prices
            suggest, and some sales carry on into Cyber Week. If you miss a target price on Monday, the Black Friday figures on this page are a fair guide to what
            to wait for in December and January, and our <a href="/treadmill-black-friday-deals/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">Black Friday treadmill deals</a> page covers the wider
            market. Avoid paying a premium in mid-December just to beat a delivery date: a pad bought in early January at
            the same price is the same pad.
          </p>
